# Claude Instructions — {{WORKSPACE_NAME|default("AI Workspace")}}

This repository uses a multi-repository, AI-native workspace pattern.

## Core Rules
- Read `AGENTS.md`, `docs/workflow.md`, and `docs/architecture.md` for workspace conventions.
- Planning source of truth is under `docs/planning/`.
- Maintain strict separation between remote issue trackers and local story markdown files.
- Before implementing a story, verify it has `Definition of Ready | Done` and `Effort | Small` or `Medium`.
- Prefer micro-surgical edits over large refactors.
- Verify changes with targeted test commands before submitting merge/pull requests.
